{"v":4,"catch":"別讓它逃走，細菌，把它吸起來，捲起來！ ！","desc":"《Rug Rats》是 Nichibutsu 於 1982 年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n成為吸塵器 KOOMIL，消滅妨礙清潔的細菌。\n如果你點燃肥皂並擊暈細菌，你就可以吸入它。\n如果你能讓所有的人都參與墊子的旋轉中，你就會得到高分。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-06-06","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de4c49469a2f3ad5876179f0224f99cf760e6716027cc2ef56ade73fe31931bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e30306ea9d43c172c5e7f67eeae72989f971e3b9c7a7b17235d20c015e363710.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4598a84dfb0b917b4d0b5af3b6d273220a4e6c624fe6ba2b36e24f25f0647c0e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/11f6adb40edb2f93aa479f49f790ba82dbbbe41ac382af2c8a79ad3ed96423b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b85b1d2f78a94221a509d6073843526e7f35ae6df93b333a2dc798bbd1db026.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bc4e0873fb5bf4afe7237a898cd0732226f86a67b4a846b4434d9e669e15b48c.jpg"],"titleId":"010097b01cb02000","dlc":[]}